151 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E ("On February 20, 2026, the U.S. Supreme Court ruled that tariffs imposed under IEEPA were not authorized. The ruling does not establish a refund process, and significant uncertainty remains regarding the mechanics of recovery. Because the process, timing, and amount of any recovery are subject to administrative guidance and potential appeal, we are unable to estimate the financial effects at this time.")
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
152 0 obj
<<
