/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
153 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E ("Following the SCOTUS ruling on IEEPA tariffs, the Company is evaluating potential recoveries. However, on February 24, 2026, new tariffs were imposed under Section 122 of the Trade Act of 1974 for a period of 150 days. The Company is currently assessing the impact of these new duties and the administrative requirements of the CBP refund portal. At this time, no recovery amounts have been recognized as the timing and net financial impact remain uncertain.")
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
